-dtm-language-decision</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.1–9.2, print pp. 378–390; PDF pp. 400–412; local effective program/tuple representation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§8.2, Theorem 8.3, pp. 180–181; scans 188–189"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。识别与判定含义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}iff\\text{-}re\\text{-}and\\text{-}core}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow(L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}iff\\text{-}re\\text{-}and\\text{-}core}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow(L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>判定器和交换终态后的判定器识别两侧。反向在输入 w 上交错模拟两个识别器，恰有一侧必须最终接受；该侧决定输出且保证停机。顺序运行一个再运行另一个会被发散阻断，不能替代交错模拟。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$、$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。识别与判定含义见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$、$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。识别与判定含义见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}iff\\text{-}re\\text{-}and\\text{-}core}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow(L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma})","display":true}],"bytes":1668,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-decidable-iff-re-and-core|可判定恰为自身与补集均可识别]]"}